{"id":"wb-6-488","name":"大召","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大召","text":"大召（蒙古语：ᠶᠡᠬᠡ ᠵᠤᠤ，西里尔字母：Их Зуу），称“伊克召”意为“大庙”，其中“召”为藏语“寺庙”之意。位于中华人民共和国内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市玉泉区大召前街，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院。大召居于明清时期呼和浩特地区“七大召”之首。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%AC","revisionId":93942459,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93942459","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9ae6471043acca142890e19f.jpg","title":"Dazhao_(Wuliang)_Temple_of_Hohhot2.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dazhao_(Wuliang)_Temple_of_Hohhot2.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Dazhao_%28Wuliang%29_Temple_of_Hohhot2.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"兜兜","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​呼和浩特大召（无量寺）","width":320,"height":240}}